        "text": "Manatal lists 34 MCP tools, including add_candidate_education, add_candidate_experience, add_candidate_note, add_candidate_to_job, add_contact_note, add_job_note, add_organization_note, create_candidate, create_employer, create_job, create_organization, and create_position."
      }
